        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Instantiates a ThinLTO code generator. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns NULL on error (check <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_l_t_o_1gae09912101ce40de1049e5bf6355f6137" kindref="member">lto_get_error_message()</ref> for details).</para>
<para>The ThinLTOCodeGenerator is not intended to be reuse for multiple compilation: the model is that the client adds modules to the generator and ask to perform the ThinLTO optimizations / codegen, and finally destroys the codegenerator.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="since"><para>LTO_API_VERSION=18 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
